DESCRIPTION:The Education Committee and Racial Equity Group of the Congreg
 ation at Duke University Chapel invite you to a meaningful and engaging h
 alf-day retreat on Saturday\, April 18\, at Trinity Avenue Presbyterian C
 hurch.\n\nLed by congregation staff member Mindy Erdmann\, this year's th
 eme "Race and the Bible: How Misuse of Scripture Leads to Racial Division
  and What We Can Do About It" will offer space for thoughtful reflection\
 , honest conversation\, and faithful learning.\n\nThe retreat will take p
 lace from 9:00 a.m. to 1:00 p.m.\, with lunch provided.\n\nRegistration i
 s now open and we encourage you to sign up soon to reserve your spot.\n\n
 Registration deadline is April 15 for attendees and youth (ages 10 and up
 )\n\nCome be part of this important opportunity to grow\, listen\, and en
 gage together as a community. We hope you'll join us.
DURATION:PT4H
