  to the public.\n\nFriday and Saturday\, April 17 & 18\, 7:30 PM.\nRubens
 tein Arts Center\, von der Heyden Theater.\n\nFree parking available in t
 he Campus Drive lot across Anderson Street: https://maps.duke.edu/?focus=
 2066-C53\n\nNew Choreographic Works by Dance Program Faculty: Ife Presswo
 od\, Ava LaVonne Vinesett\, Tania Suárez\, Kristin Taylor Duncan\, and Ni
 na Wheeler\, Graduate students: Celeste Brace and Amanda Fuenzalida and u
 ndergraduate students: Riley Campbell and Arely Sun.\n\n\n\nPhoto credit:
  \nPhotographer: Cammel Hurse\nChoreography: Tristian Griffin\nDancers: A
 lexa Lattanze\, Alicía Ogliari\, Alina Besteman\, and Linzi Huang
