DESCRIPTION:The Congregation's weekly Adult Forum offers a variety of gues
 t speakers\, presentations and discussions on a wide range of thought-pro
 voking topics\, including Biblical studies\, current social issues and th
 e work of mission agencies.\n\nThis week we welcome Dr. Meredith Riedel. 
 Dr. Riedel is a writer\, historian\, and an Assistant Professor of Histor
 y of Christianity at Duke University's Divinity School.
