DESCRIPTION:1st Annual Duke University School of Nursing Rural Health Symp
 osium. \nHealthcare professionals\, educators\, researchers\, community l
 eaders\, and policymakers\, join Duke University School of Nursing for a 
 one-day symposium dedicated to reducing rural health disparities across N
 orth Carolina through collaboration and innovation. On April 20 from 9am-
 3pm at Duke University (and virtual via livestream)\, come together for d
 ynamic presentations\, panels\, poster sessions\, and discussions with gu
 ests including leaders from ECU Health\, Sanford Health\, UT-Arlington\, 
 and the NC Department of Health and Human Services. A reception will foll
 ow the program.
DURATION:PT6H
