DESCRIPTION:Visual Arts\, Cinematic Arts\, and Documentary Studies would l
 ike to cordially invite you to the 2026 Senior Thesis Exhibition!\n\nPlea
 se join us at the Rubenstein Arts Center this Monday\, April 20th for our
  Visual Arts gallery show opening at 6pm in the upstairs gallery and pain
 ting studio\, followed by a reception. At 8pm\, the program will continue
  with a Cinematic Arts and Documentary Studies screening and table read i
 n the film theater.\n\nPlease share with anyone who may be interested. We
  hope to see you there!\n\nExhibiting Artists\nLexie Belgrad • Maya Crawf
 ord • Emily Dieu\nJackson Garvey • Brooke Hira • Skylar Knight \nCourtney
  Lucius • Jordan Moyd • Felix Zhu \n\nScreening Artists\nRichard Schulz •
  Evelyn Shue\n\nReading Artists\nIan McPherson • Riley Reece • Yurina Shi
 rai
DURATION:PT3H
